00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:43.480 line:20%
QINGSONG CEMENT FACTORY, WEIYANG CITY

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:50.040 line:20%
REFORM FOR GROWTH

00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:03.680 line:100%
DRIVE SLOWLY, SAFETY FIRST

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:19.800 line:100%
Sir. Busy? Have a drink.

00:02:19.880 --> 00:02:20.840 line:100%
No, thanks.

00:02:23.440 --> 00:02:24.680 line:100%
Anyway,

00:02:24.760 --> 00:02:26.960 line:100%
did the owner of the factory come today?

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:28.360 line:100%
Which owner?

00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:30.200 line:100%
Mr. Song Qingsong.

00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:33.480 line:100%
I don't know about that,
but you can't park your car there.

00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:35.080 line:100%
If you're not here to get it fixed,
move it away.

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:36.080 line:100%
Understood?

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:37.760 line:100%
Get it fixed.

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:38.840 line:100%
I'm here to get it fixed.

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:41.480 line:100%
Look how damaged it is.
Check it and quote a price.

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:45.240 line:100%
You parked at a great spot.

00:02:48.840 --> 00:02:51.040 line:100%
Your car is seriously damaged.

00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:52.880 line:100%
Did the other person run away?

00:02:56.240 --> 00:02:57.600 line:100%
Stop staring.

00:02:57.680 --> 00:02:59.080 line:100%
You won't see Song here.

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:00.600 line:100%
Why is that?

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:03.560 line:100%
Those who can see Song
won't come to me and ask about him.

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:07.600 line:100%
But isn't it weird?

00:03:08.360 --> 00:03:10.440 line:100%
The place is locked up tight.

00:03:10.520 --> 00:03:12.960 line:100%
And the guard is strong.

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:15.200 line:100%
One might even say
he's guarding an armory.

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:16.280 line:100%
Have you not heard?

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:18.160 line:100%
There was a gang fight here two days ago.

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:19.600 line:100%
More than 200 men.

00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:21.200 line:100%
It was huge.

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:22.840 line:100%
I lost some of my wrenches.

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:25.200 line:100%
A gang fight? With whom?

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:26.440 line:100%
Cripple Du.

00:03:26.960 --> 00:03:28.480 line:100%
Song's rival.

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:29.600 line:100%
But why?

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:32.360 line:100%
For business. The business in the mine.

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:34.520 line:100%
The mine?

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:36.600 line:100%
Dongshan Mine?

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:38.720 line:100%
Do you see another mine in Weiyang?

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:44.000 line:100%
It's run by the government.
Very lucrative.

00:03:56.200 --> 00:03:58.320 line:100%
QINGSONG CEMENT

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:19.600 line:100%
PATTIA FRONT DESK

00:04:19.680 --> 00:04:21.079 line:100%
Uncle Ran,

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:22.440 line:100%
now that we have checked
the underground labyrinth,

00:04:22.520 --> 00:04:24.880 line:100%
it's time to check the labyrinth upstairs.

00:04:25.680 --> 00:04:27.720 line:100%
We need to change our method for that.

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:28.760 line:100%
Change our method?

00:04:29.360 --> 00:04:30.760 line:100%
We'll use Tremeaux's algorithm.

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:33.040 line:100%
Tremor? Like land tremors?

00:04:33.760 --> 00:04:34.840 line:100%
Here.

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:38.800 line:100%
Trémaux's algorithm
is the most time-intensive

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:42.200 line:100%
yet the most likely to succeed
among all labyrinth solvers.

00:04:42.280 --> 00:04:45.480 line:100%
In short, take every route

00:04:45.560 --> 00:04:48.120 line:100%
and mark them so that we don't make
the same mistake.

00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:50.800 line:100%
In the end, we'll find the exit.

00:04:50.880 --> 00:04:53.680 line:100%
To translate it
into our investigation, it means

00:04:53.760 --> 00:04:54.720 line:100%
we have to first find a lead.

00:04:55.320 --> 00:04:58.120 line:100%
Uncle Ran, you make it sound
too complicated.

00:04:58.200 --> 00:05:00.200 line:100%
Forget about tremors. Just do this.

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:03.560 line:100%
This is the entrance. This is the exit.

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:05.960 line:100%
Now, you'll find the solution.

00:05:09.480 --> 00:05:10.480 line:100%
Give it back.

00:05:25.160 --> 00:05:27.120 line:100%
WEIYANG CITY DONGSHAN
MINE OPERATION CONTRACTOR TENDER DOCUMENT

00:05:27.200 --> 00:05:28.240 line:100%
Come in.

00:05:35.280 --> 00:05:36.400 line:100%
Mr. Song.

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:37.440 line:100%
Hear me out.

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:38.560 line:100%
Yesterday, I…

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:41.960 line:100%
You did well last night.

00:05:42.920 --> 00:05:44.320 line:100%
You're smart.

00:05:46.840 --> 00:05:47.840 line:100%
This is your reward.

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:50.960 line:100%
Mr. Song, I was just doing my job.

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:52.160 line:100%
So, take it.

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:53.280 line:100%
I…

00:05:53.960 --> 00:05:55.080 line:100%
Thank you.

00:06:00.640 --> 00:06:02.280 line:100%
When will you return the things
worth hundreds of thousands of yuan

00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:03.760 line:100%
stolen from Yuanlongli?

00:06:04.360 --> 00:06:05.360 line:100%
Immediately.

00:06:05.880 --> 00:06:07.080 line:100%
Immediately.

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:09.680 line:100%
Where did you bury the woman?

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:13.040 line:100%
After I was released yesterday,
the police have been following me.

00:06:13.120 --> 00:06:14.640 line:100%
I'll dig out the body now.

00:06:15.320 --> 00:06:16.760 line:100%
Did I tell you to do that?

00:06:17.880 --> 00:06:19.200 line:100%
Are you dumb?

00:06:19.280 --> 00:06:21.000 line:100%
Then, I won't dig the body out. I…

00:06:21.080 --> 00:06:22.520 line:100%
Burn it. Destroy it.

00:06:22.600 --> 00:06:24.960 line:100%
Dissolve it. Deal with it.

00:06:25.040 --> 00:06:26.080 line:100%
Okay.

00:06:32.080 --> 00:06:34.480 line:100%
Take a picture before you get rid of it.

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:35.600 line:100%
Okay.

00:06:46.040 --> 00:06:47.240 line:100%
AUTO MAINTENANCE, REPAIR SHOP

00:06:47.320 --> 00:06:48.480 line:100%
Mr. Song.

00:06:48.560 --> 00:06:50.120 line:100%
The officer from yesterday
is still waiting outside.

00:06:50.200 --> 00:06:51.760 line:100%
What if he follows me?

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:55.120 line:100%
You made a mess and you expect me
to clean up after you?

00:07:02.280 --> 00:07:05.000 line:100%
If you fail to handle this properly
and the police find out,

00:07:05.080 --> 00:07:06.320 line:100%
you'll turn yourself in.

00:07:07.760 --> 00:07:08.840 line:100%
Otherwise,

00:07:10.360 --> 00:07:12.000 line:100%
I'll make your family disappear.

00:07:20.760 --> 00:07:22.680 line:100%
Let's see how long you can stay in there.

00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:30.400 line:20%
QINGSONG CEMENT FACTORY, WEIYANG CITY

00:07:35.800 --> 00:07:38.760 line:20%
I'M BRINGING XIAOHE TO YUANLONGLI. RAN

00:07:38.840 --> 00:07:40.160 line:100%
Yuanlongli?

00:07:41.680 --> 00:07:43.360 line:100%
Why that place of all places?

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:46.040 line:100%
QINGSONG CEMENT FACTORY, WEIYANG CITY

00:07:56.920 --> 00:07:58.000 line:100%
Stop!

00:08:01.520 --> 00:08:02.360 line:100%
XINFENG AUTO REPAIR

00:08:11.600 --> 00:08:13.760 line:100%
Who told you to do this? You jerk!

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:15.240 line:100%
Asshole!

00:08:17.080 --> 00:08:18.600 line:100%
Hey! Hey!

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:21.240 line:100%
Song Qingsong, you son of…

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:30.720 line:100%
Careful, Xiaohe.

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:38.240 line:100%
Xiaohe.

00:08:38.320 --> 00:08:39.240 line:100%
Slow down.

00:08:40.719 --> 00:08:42.880 line:100%
Red, orange, yellow, green,

00:08:42.959 --> 00:08:44.080 line:100%
green, blue, purple.

00:08:44.680 --> 00:08:46.480 line:100%
Everyone is here.

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:14.680 line:100%
Big butt!

00:09:16.800 --> 00:09:18.560 line:100%
-Big butt!
-What are you doing?

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:24.040 line:100%
Let go!

00:09:24.120 --> 00:09:25.400 line:100%
Let go!

00:09:31.280 --> 00:09:32.960 line:100%
Rat! Pickpocket! Money-grubber!

00:09:33.040 --> 00:09:36.280 line:100%
How come everywhere we go,
we always see you?

00:09:36.360 --> 00:09:37.960 line:100%
It's you again?

00:09:38.560 --> 00:09:40.720 line:100%
Mr. Qian. She is asking your question.

00:09:40.800 --> 00:09:42.240 line:100%
Officer Ran,

00:09:42.840 --> 00:09:46.720 line:100%
someone complained about a stench.

00:09:46.800 --> 00:09:48.120 line:100%
So, I came up here to check.

00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:52.400 line:100%
I thought someone
must have planted something.

00:09:52.480 --> 00:09:54.880 line:100%
Who knew that someone
was raising chickens here?

00:09:54.960 --> 00:09:56.000 line:100%
Unbelievable.

00:09:57.880 --> 00:09:59.560 line:100%
Why did you enter the chicken coop then?

00:10:00.680 --> 00:10:02.320 line:100%
To count the chickens.

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:04.600 line:100%
How can I fine them without knowing
how many chickens are here?

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:07.280 line:100%
I'll get someone from the management here.

00:10:07.360 --> 00:10:08.600 line:100%
This is unbelievable.

00:10:09.200 --> 00:10:10.880 line:100%
Unbelievable! I must clean it!

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:15.280 line:100%
The chicken coop needs to be removed.

00:10:15.360 --> 00:10:16.320 line:100%
Qian!

00:10:16.400 --> 00:10:19.240 line:100%
-How dare you!
-Sir.

00:10:19.960 --> 00:10:20.800 line:100%
Sir.

00:10:22.480 --> 00:10:23.400 line:100%
What are you doing?

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:26.560 line:100%
Qian Dajun.

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:27.480 line:100%
Calm down.

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:29.080 line:100%
Let me make myself clear today.

00:10:29.160 --> 00:10:31.960 line:100%
Touch my chickens
and I'll chop off your hands.

00:10:32.640 --> 00:10:33.920 line:100%
Sir. Calm down.

00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:35.320 line:100%
There's an officer here.

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:36.720 line:100%
-Calm down.
-I don't care!

00:10:36.800 --> 00:10:38.400 line:100%
-Calm down. Calm down.
-Stay right there.

00:10:38.480 --> 00:10:40.360 line:100%
-Stay right there.
-Calm down.

00:10:43.040 --> 00:10:44.120 line:100%
Calm down.

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:46.400 line:100%
-That jerk.
-Calm down.

00:10:48.760 --> 00:10:51.200 line:100%
Mister, you're amazing.

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:54.040 line:100%
Did you raise all these colorful chickens?

00:10:56.840 --> 00:10:59.920 line:100%
Yes. Little girl, do you like them?

00:11:00.440 --> 00:11:02.800 line:100%
If you like them, I can give you one.

00:11:02.880 --> 00:11:04.400 line:100%
Thanks, mister.

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:12.000 line:100%
Forget about it.
My mother won't let me raise it.

00:11:13.040 --> 00:11:14.080 line:100%
Give me a moment.

00:11:35.480 --> 00:11:36.840 line:100%
Thank you, mister.

00:11:38.120 --> 00:11:41.120 line:100%
I wonder what color this chick will be.

00:11:41.200 --> 00:11:42.120 line:100%
Hey!

00:11:42.880 --> 00:11:44.200 line:100%
It's a raw egg!

00:12:06.640 --> 00:12:10.880 line:20%
DANFENG MIDDLE SCHOOL

00:12:10.960 --> 00:12:12.920 line:100%
PRINCIPAL'S ROOM

00:12:17.400 --> 00:12:18.920 line:100%
Officer He, this is the place.

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:19.880 line:100%
Thank you.

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:20.960 line:100%
You're welcome.

00:12:22.240 --> 00:12:23.280 line:100%
Come in.

00:12:24.280 --> 00:12:26.760 line:100%
Hello, Principal Qin. I am He Xiaohe.

00:12:26.840 --> 00:12:28.680 line:100%
I'm here for Han Zi'ang.

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:29.640 line:100%
Oh.

00:12:30.160 --> 00:12:32.280 line:100%
Officer He. Take a seat.

00:12:32.360 --> 00:12:33.480 line:100%
Thank you.

00:12:36.200 --> 00:12:40.040 line:100%
Principal Qin, I know you're a busy man,
so I'll keep it brief.

00:12:40.120 --> 00:12:44.360 line:100%
I came to urge you
to reconsider the decision

00:12:44.440 --> 00:12:46.520 line:100%
to expel Han Zi'ang.

00:12:47.400 --> 00:12:48.560 line:100%
Officer He.

00:12:48.640 --> 00:12:51.040 line:100%
I already explained to you clearly

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:53.240 line:100%
in our phone call yesterday.

00:12:54.200 --> 00:12:58.880 line:100%
It's a decision that we made
upon deliberate consideration.

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:00.080 line:100%
But…

00:13:00.800 --> 00:13:02.640 line:100%
Please let me finish.

00:13:03.520 --> 00:13:05.520 line:100%
The expulsion isn't my decision.

00:13:06.200 --> 00:13:09.720 line:100%
In class, Han Zi'ang dozes off often.

00:13:09.800 --> 00:13:12.280 line:100%
And he often misses classes
for no reason at all.

00:13:12.360 --> 00:13:15.000 line:100%
This time, instead of truancy,

00:13:15.600 --> 00:13:18.040 line:100%
he stabbed someone outside.

00:13:18.120 --> 00:13:21.480 line:100%
Principal Qin, does Han Zi'ang
have a history of violence?

00:13:23.160 --> 00:13:24.160 line:100%
Not that I know of.

00:13:24.840 --> 00:13:29.160 line:100%
His homeroom teacher told us
that he was usually quiet.

00:13:29.680 --> 00:13:34.160 line:100%
But you know, the quiet one
turns out to be the most volatile.

00:13:34.240 --> 00:13:35.480 line:100%
This is just a stereotype.

00:13:36.160 --> 00:13:39.280 line:100%
From what I was told,
Han Zi'ang is indeed an introvert.

00:13:39.360 --> 00:13:41.040 line:100%
But that's because he likes to read.

00:13:41.120 --> 00:13:44.400 line:100%
Of course, what he reads are comic books.

00:13:44.480 --> 00:13:48.520 line:100%
Perhaps he mixed
fictional elements with reality.

00:13:49.320 --> 00:13:51.520 line:100%
When he heard that Yuanlongli was haunted,

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:53.560 line:100%
he went on an adventure.

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:55.160 line:100%
He ran into a homeless guy,

00:13:55.760 --> 00:13:58.880 line:100%
and then maybe, he was anxious and scared.

00:13:58.960 --> 00:14:01.760 line:100%
So, he stabbed him to defend himself.

00:14:01.840 --> 00:14:08.400 line:100%
Officer He, you're saying
that Han Zi'ang acted out of self-defense.

00:14:08.920 --> 00:14:09.920 line:100%
I get that.

00:14:10.520 --> 00:14:12.840 line:100%
But the parents don't get that.

00:14:12.920 --> 00:14:14.160 line:100%
He stabbed someone.

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:15.440 line:100%
That's the truth.

00:14:15.520 --> 00:14:17.560 line:100%
If he comes to school,

00:14:17.640 --> 00:14:20.440 line:100%
the other parents will be worried sick.

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:27.600 line:100%
He is still unconscious in the hospital.

00:14:27.680 --> 00:14:31.000 line:100%
The police are doing their best
to investigate the case.

00:14:31.080 --> 00:14:33.200 line:100%
Before the truth comes out,

00:14:33.280 --> 00:14:36.120 line:100%
I urge the school not to give up on him.

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:39.400 line:100%
If someone lends him a hand
at a time like this,

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:42.000 line:100%
you're not just saving his education,

00:14:42.760 --> 00:14:44.440 line:100%
you're saving his life.

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:47.240 line:100%
Principal Qin.

00:14:47.880 --> 00:14:48.960 line:100%
In fact,

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:53.160 line:100%
I was worse and more rebellious
than he was back then.

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:57.760 line:100%
But someone in my life
never gave up on me.

00:14:57.840 --> 00:15:03.040 line:100%
He pulled me back in time
and saved my life.

00:15:03.120 --> 00:15:05.760 line:100%
That's why I can be
an officer like I am now.

00:15:07.160 --> 00:15:09.920 line:100%
Principal Qin, for a child,

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:14.280 line:100%
one decision can determine his whole life.

00:15:14.360 --> 00:15:18.120 line:100%
I urge you to reconsider.

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:23.200 line:100%
Perhaps you can be the one
who saves Han Zi'ang.

00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:29.760 line:100%
Officer He, how about this?

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:32.760 line:100%
Since Han Zi'ang is still unconscious,

00:15:32.840 --> 00:15:36.000 line:100%
we'll delay his expulsion
as much as possible.

00:15:36.600 --> 00:15:38.240 line:100%
Before the investigation comes to an end,

00:15:38.320 --> 00:15:40.160 line:100%
I can speak on behalf of the school

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:44.120 line:100%
that if the police
provide proof that Han Zi'ang

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:47.600 line:100%
acted out of self-defense,

00:15:47.680 --> 00:15:50.160 line:100%
then we can reconsider the expulsion.

00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:52.560 line:100%
Okay.

00:15:52.640 --> 00:15:53.520 line:100%
Thank you.

00:15:53.600 --> 00:15:55.320 line:100%
Thank you, Principal Qin.

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:09.880 line:100%
Even at this age, Xiaohe is still a rebel.

00:16:09.960 --> 00:16:13.520 line:100%
She just swallows whatever hardships.

00:16:13.600 --> 00:16:17.360 line:100%
Sir, Xiaohe is almost like my junior.

00:16:17.440 --> 00:16:19.280 line:100%
She studied for six years
to be a criminal police officer.

00:16:19.360 --> 00:16:20.440 line:100%
Have faith in her.

00:16:21.120 --> 00:16:23.200 line:100%
She's my daughter.
Of course, I have faith in her.

00:16:23.280 --> 00:16:25.160 line:100%
I'm her dad, after all.

00:16:26.640 --> 00:16:28.560 line:100%
She also grew up under your nose.

00:16:28.640 --> 00:16:30.600 line:100%
But this is her first case.

00:16:30.680 --> 00:16:32.920 line:100%
She needs all the support she can have.

00:16:35.120 --> 00:16:37.080 line:100%
It was my first case back then too.

00:16:37.160 --> 00:16:39.160 line:100%
But you didn't pamper me.

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:42.040 line:100%
Nonsense!

00:16:42.120 --> 00:16:44.120 line:100%
Did you acknowledge me
as your mentor back then?

00:16:46.240 --> 00:16:48.920 line:100%
The older you are,
the more grudges you hold.

00:16:55.400 --> 00:16:57.760 line:100%
NOTICE, YUANLONGLI INTERNATIONAL
GARDEN REDEVELOPMENT MEETING

00:16:57.840 --> 00:16:59.960 line:100%
THE MEETING WILL BE HELD AT 1 P.M. TODAY.

00:17:14.639 --> 00:17:16.399 line:100%
Why did they seal it off?

00:17:17.639 --> 00:17:20.080 line:100%
That side wasn't involved.
Why seal that place?

00:17:20.159 --> 00:17:21.360 line:100%
Let's go, sir.

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:23.600 line:100%
SEALED, NANSHAN BRANCH
WEIYANG PUBLIC SECURITY BUREAU

00:17:25.600 --> 00:17:27.040 line:100%
I don't think we'll find anything here.

00:17:27.800 --> 00:17:29.320 line:100%
Should we go to the surveillance room?

00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:31.600 line:100%
Sir.

00:17:32.120 --> 00:17:34.280 line:100%
The surveillance room
was demolished a long time ago.

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:35.280 line:100%
You already know about that.

00:17:36.440 --> 00:17:37.400 line:100%
Oh.

00:17:38.720 --> 00:17:39.960 line:100%
Then, let's head
to the underground car park.

00:17:40.600 --> 00:17:41.920 line:100%
I bet you have no idea

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:44.720 line:100%
what it has become after all these years.

00:17:44.800 --> 00:17:47.120 line:100%
Sir, let's leave.

00:17:47.200 --> 00:17:48.720 line:100%
Just stay out of the case.

00:17:49.240 --> 00:17:50.560 line:100%
If this turns out to be a prank…

00:17:50.640 --> 00:17:53.400 line:100%
Eighteen years ago,
they also said the Xu Meng case

00:17:53.480 --> 00:17:54.600 line:100%
was a prank.

00:17:54.680 --> 00:17:56.040 line:100%
What did you do?

00:18:03.880 --> 00:18:06.520 line:100%
Sir, just tell the truth.

00:18:09.760 --> 00:18:11.680 line:100%
You want to keep me here in Weiyang

00:18:11.760 --> 00:18:14.080 line:100%
to investigate the case 18 years ago.

00:18:21.560 --> 00:18:23.400 line:100%
Qiao lives in Yuanlongli.

00:18:23.920 --> 00:18:25.080 line:100%
Don't you want to see her?

00:18:39.520 --> 00:18:40.680 line:100%
Officer Ran.

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:42.680 line:100%
Qiao.

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:44.800 line:100%
Sorry to disturb you again.

00:18:47.640 --> 00:18:48.480 line:100%
And this is…

00:18:48.560 --> 00:18:51.080 line:100%
Hi, miss. I am He Xiaohe.

00:18:51.160 --> 00:18:53.160 line:100%
My father is He Yuanhang.

00:18:53.240 --> 00:18:55.280 line:100%
He works with Uncle Ran.

00:18:56.240 --> 00:18:58.360 line:100%
Hi, Xiaohe. I am Qiao Suqing.

00:18:58.440 --> 00:18:59.360 line:100%
It's nice to meet you.

00:19:01.800 --> 00:19:03.520 line:100%
Miss, you're so pretty.

00:19:03.600 --> 00:19:07.040 line:100%
No wonder Uncle Ran
brought me here specifically.

00:19:13.200 --> 00:19:15.000 line:100%
Come. Come in.

00:19:16.200 --> 00:19:17.480 line:100%
Change your shoes.

00:19:40.120 --> 00:19:41.000 line:100%
Xiaohe.

00:19:41.080 --> 00:19:42.680 line:100%
What do you want to drink?

00:19:42.760 --> 00:19:44.240 line:20%
-This one.
-This one?

00:19:45.480 --> 00:19:46.680 line:100%
Then, Officer Ran…

00:19:47.400 --> 00:19:48.320 line:100%
Thank you.

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:51.200 line:100%
-Here.
-Thank you.

00:19:55.600 --> 00:19:58.440 line:100%
Miss, your house is so clean.

00:19:58.520 --> 00:19:59.440 line:100%
And it smells good too.

00:20:00.240 --> 00:20:01.560 line:100%
Thank you, Xiaohe.

00:20:01.640 --> 00:20:02.720 line:100%
I'm living alone.

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:05.120 line:100%
When I'm free, I like to clean my house.

00:20:05.200 --> 00:20:06.960 line:100%
You're living alone?

00:20:07.040 --> 00:20:08.440 line:100%
Do you have a boyfriend?

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:12.480 line:100%
No.

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:14.920 line:100%
From what I know,

00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:17.800 line:100%
Uncle Ran doesn't have
a girlfriend either.

00:20:23.560 --> 00:20:25.600 line:100%
Don't get me wrong.

00:20:25.680 --> 00:20:28.000 line:100%
I'm just telling facts.

00:20:36.560 --> 00:20:37.680 line:100%
Xiaohe.

00:20:37.760 --> 00:20:39.200 line:100%
Go take a shower here.

00:20:39.280 --> 00:20:40.560 line:100%
I'll come back later
to pick you up. All right?

00:20:40.640 --> 00:20:43.240 line:100%
No. I have to explore the maze with you.

00:20:43.320 --> 00:20:44.400 line:100%
You must stay here.

00:20:44.480 --> 00:20:45.960 line:100%
Look at you now.

00:20:46.040 --> 00:20:47.680 line:100%
When your father comes here,
how am I supposed to hand you back to him?

00:20:50.880 --> 00:20:51.920 line:100%
Come.

00:20:52.000 --> 00:20:54.640 line:100%
Xiaohe. Let's get you
all cleaned up, okay?

00:20:55.720 --> 00:20:57.160 line:100%
Officer Ran, don't let me keep you.

00:20:57.240 --> 00:20:58.720 line:100%
I'll take care of Xiaohe.

00:20:58.800 --> 00:20:59.880 line:100%
Don't worry.

00:21:01.120 --> 00:21:01.960 line:100%
Thank you.

00:21:02.800 --> 00:21:04.600 line:100%
Uncle Ran, you're blushing.

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:08.040 line:100%
Am I?

00:21:09.120 --> 00:21:10.920 line:100%
Let's go to the shower.

00:21:26.440 --> 00:21:27.680 line:100%
Officer He.

00:21:28.640 --> 00:21:29.880 line:100%
What happened to you?

00:21:29.960 --> 00:21:31.320 line:100%
Is the case almost over?

00:21:31.400 --> 00:21:34.240 line:100%
I'm waiting for my tip-off reward.

00:21:35.080 --> 00:21:36.160 line:100%
So am I.

00:21:37.960 --> 00:21:40.040 line:100%
Please supervise the young one well.

00:21:40.120 --> 00:21:43.120 line:100%
Don't let him
get carried away by his needs.

00:21:43.640 --> 00:21:44.520 line:100%
Young one? Who?

00:21:44.600 --> 00:21:45.760 line:100%
Officer Ran.

00:21:46.280 --> 00:21:49.440 line:100%
I keep seeing him visiting Unit 415.

00:21:49.520 --> 00:21:51.600 line:100%
A mistress lives there.

00:21:52.360 --> 00:21:53.400 line:100%
Don't make things up.

00:21:53.480 --> 00:21:54.640 line:100%
I didn't.

00:21:54.720 --> 00:21:57.120 line:100%
I just saw him take a little girl

00:21:57.200 --> 00:21:59.240 line:100%
to the mistress's home.

00:22:05.320 --> 00:22:07.920 line:100%
Du, if you are bored,

00:22:08.000 --> 00:22:11.560 line:100%
study how the amazing detectives
solve the cases in your detective novels.

00:22:11.640 --> 00:22:14.080 line:100%
Don't just stare at your neighbors
and spread rumors.

00:22:14.160 --> 00:22:15.440 line:100%
But I…

00:22:17.280 --> 00:22:18.320 line:100%
You told me

00:22:18.400 --> 00:22:20.520 line:100%
to give you useful information,
didn't you?

00:22:21.360 --> 00:22:22.560 line:100%
I can't believe it.

00:22:24.880 --> 00:22:26.600 line:100%
Come. Eat while it's warm.

00:22:26.680 --> 00:22:27.640 line:100%
Wow!

00:22:28.320 --> 00:22:29.560 line:100%
Ms. Qiao.

00:22:29.640 --> 00:22:33.600 line:100%
You're just like a real-life super nanny.

00:22:34.360 --> 00:22:35.960 line:100%
You're a smooth-talker.

00:22:36.040 --> 00:22:37.000 line:100%
Dig in.

00:22:43.400 --> 00:22:44.360 line:100%
What's the matter?

00:22:45.320 --> 00:22:48.520 line:100%
It'd be great if I could call you
auntie in the future.

00:22:49.680 --> 00:22:51.440 line:100%
Witty, aren't you?

00:22:52.080 --> 00:22:55.000 line:100%
I've never thought
of Officer Ran that way.

00:22:55.880 --> 00:22:56.720 line:100%
You're lying.

00:22:57.400 --> 00:22:58.840 line:100%
I'm telling the truth.

00:22:58.920 --> 00:23:01.520 line:100%
I was just saying
I'd like to call you auntie.

00:23:01.600 --> 00:23:04.200 line:100%
Why did you think of Uncle Ran right away?

00:23:06.040 --> 00:23:07.040 line:100%
How dare you!

00:23:09.720 --> 00:23:10.720 line:100%
Coming.

00:23:12.840 --> 00:23:15.600 line:100%
You can't wait to see him.

00:23:21.120 --> 00:23:21.960 line:100%
You're…

00:23:22.040 --> 00:23:22.920 line:100%
Dad!

00:23:24.520 --> 00:23:25.680 line:100%
Xiaohe.

00:23:26.440 --> 00:23:28.440 line:100%
Officer He. Come in.

00:23:28.520 --> 00:23:30.400 line:100%
It's okay. I'm all dusty.

00:23:30.480 --> 00:23:32.200 line:100%
-I'm here to pick my kid up.
-It's okay.

00:23:32.280 --> 00:23:34.360 line:100%
Dad, I went inside
a chicken coop just now.

00:23:34.440 --> 00:23:36.080 line:100%
Did you go inside a pigsty or something?

00:23:36.160 --> 00:23:38.760 line:100%
I didn't get into a pigsty,
but I was harassed by pigs.

00:23:39.640 --> 00:23:41.160 line:100%
Officer He. Please come in.

00:23:41.240 --> 00:23:42.240 line:100%
Let me get you a fresh towel.

00:23:43.160 --> 00:23:44.280 line:100%
Sorry about that.

00:23:49.080 --> 00:23:51.400 line:100%
You even took a shower. Where's Uncle Ran?

00:23:51.480 --> 00:23:54.400 line:100%
He's solving the maze on the 18th floor.

00:23:54.480 --> 00:23:57.000 line:100%
Ms. Qiao's shampoo smells so good.

00:23:57.080 --> 00:23:58.440 line:100%
Her egg noodles are delicious too.

00:23:58.520 --> 00:24:01.920 line:100%
Dad, you must thank her
for taking good care of me.

00:24:04.320 --> 00:24:06.000 line:100%
Here, Officer He. Clean yourself.

00:24:06.080 --> 00:24:07.040 line:100%
Sure. Thank you.

00:24:07.120 --> 00:24:08.800 line:100%
My daughter must have troubled you a lot.

00:24:08.880 --> 00:24:11.440 line:100%
Not at all. She's so obedient.

00:24:12.280 --> 00:24:13.280 line:100%
Officer He, do stay here.

00:24:13.360 --> 00:24:16.320 line:100%
It's okay. I'll just wipe myself quickly.

00:24:19.240 --> 00:24:21.600 line:100%
Dad, I love Ms. Qiao.

00:24:21.680 --> 00:24:24.720 line:100%
Can Uncle Ran bring me here often?

00:24:28.240 --> 00:24:30.760 line:100%
Go. Wash the towel for Ms. Qiao.

00:24:49.120 --> 00:24:50.080 line:100%
Thank you.

00:24:54.120 --> 00:24:55.040 line:100%
Officer He,

00:24:55.640 --> 00:24:59.000 line:100%
I know I have a bad reputation

00:24:59.520 --> 00:25:02.440 line:100%
and that I should stay away
from Officer Ran.

00:25:05.640 --> 00:25:10.000 line:100%
But I am not what they say I am.

00:25:14.920 --> 00:25:16.960 line:100%
I only trust what I see with my own eyes.

00:25:17.040 --> 00:25:20.040 line:100%
Don't take those rumors to heart.

00:25:20.760 --> 00:25:22.520 line:100%
If you have done nothing wrong,

00:25:22.600 --> 00:25:25.840 line:100%
there's no need
to worry about false rumors.

00:25:37.480 --> 00:25:40.320 line:100%
COME TO THE OPPOSITE
OF THE FOOT MASSAGE PARLOR QUICKLY, LILI

00:25:44.760 --> 00:25:46.760 line:100%
Do you have to make a call?

00:25:46.840 --> 00:25:48.160 line:100%
You can use my line.

00:25:49.040 --> 00:25:49.880 line:100%
It's okay.

00:25:50.760 --> 00:25:53.920 line:100%
Can I trouble you
to look after Xiaohe for a while?

00:25:54.000 --> 00:25:55.480 line:100%
I might have to pick her up later.

00:25:55.560 --> 00:25:56.760 line:100%
Sure. No trouble at all.

00:25:56.840 --> 00:25:59.600 line:100%
I couldn't be happier that Xiaohe is here.

00:26:00.440 --> 00:26:01.960 line:100%
Me too.

00:26:02.880 --> 00:26:04.040 line:100%
Look at her.

00:26:04.120 --> 00:26:05.160 line:100%
Be a good girl.

00:26:06.240 --> 00:26:07.680 line:100%
Thank you so much.

00:26:13.360 --> 00:26:17.240 line:100%
FLEA MARKET

00:26:37.560 --> 00:26:40.360 line:100%
THE USUAL PLACE TONIGHT AT EIGHT
SEE YOU

00:26:53.480 --> 00:26:54.920 line:100%
What do you want?

00:26:55.000 --> 00:26:56.720 line:100%
Look at the car plate.

00:26:57.240 --> 00:27:00.080 line:100%
I am the deputy manager
at Qingsong Cement Factory.

00:27:00.720 --> 00:27:03.520 line:100%
Thugs like you best not touch me.

00:27:06.800 --> 00:27:09.120 line:100%
-I'm looking for you, you punk.
-For what?

00:27:09.200 --> 00:27:12.440 line:100%
A guy of mine, Wolfie,

00:27:12.520 --> 00:27:14.280 line:100%
was arrested by the police two days ago.

00:27:14.360 --> 00:27:15.960 line:100%
Do you know what happened?

00:27:16.040 --> 00:27:16.880 line:100%
No idea.

00:27:19.280 --> 00:27:20.680 line:100%
Do you know or not?

00:27:20.760 --> 00:27:22.880 line:100%
Yes. I know.

00:27:25.480 --> 00:27:26.320 line:100%
I know.

00:27:27.960 --> 00:27:29.120 line:100%
Your guy didn't kill anyone.

00:27:29.200 --> 00:27:30.440 line:100%
Don't tell me everything.

00:27:32.120 --> 00:27:34.000 line:100%
Just answer my question.

00:27:34.800 --> 00:27:35.640 line:100%
Okay.

00:27:36.360 --> 00:27:38.920 line:100%
Did Song Qingsong make the offer?

00:27:39.800 --> 00:27:40.840 line:100%
No.

00:27:40.920 --> 00:27:41.880 line:100%
I did.

00:27:42.760 --> 00:27:44.520 line:100%
I can swear on my life. I made the offer.

00:27:45.120 --> 00:27:46.360 line:100%
I'm trying to become clean, you know?

00:27:47.920 --> 00:27:49.200 line:100%
Since you made the offer,

00:27:50.320 --> 00:27:51.200 line:100%
pay up.

00:27:51.960 --> 00:27:53.040 line:100%
Pay what?

00:27:53.120 --> 00:27:55.160 line:100%
Your guy didn't even finish the job.

00:27:55.240 --> 00:27:56.600 line:100%
Why should I pay up?

00:27:57.960 --> 00:27:59.400 line:100%
Why? Why?

00:28:01.280 --> 00:28:02.760 line:100%
Did I tell you to do that?

00:28:02.840 --> 00:28:04.840 line:100%
Let's just be civil.

00:28:04.920 --> 00:28:06.080 line:100%
Be professional.

00:28:08.800 --> 00:28:13.040 line:100%
My guy is an important person
in the company.

00:28:13.560 --> 00:28:17.320 line:100%
And because of you, he was arrested
and is still not yet released.

00:28:18.080 --> 00:28:20.800 line:100%
Should we calculate the loss of profit?

00:28:20.880 --> 00:28:22.400 line:100%
The loss of profit?

00:28:22.920 --> 00:28:25.040 line:100%
Your guy didn't finish the job.

00:28:25.120 --> 00:28:28.800 line:100%
I had to clean up after him
and deal with those two.

00:28:29.920 --> 00:28:31.440 line:100%
You killed them?

00:28:32.640 --> 00:28:33.480 line:100%
Right.

00:28:35.520 --> 00:28:38.080 line:100%
I didn't know you were this ruthless.

00:28:38.160 --> 00:28:39.680 line:100%
One slash, one life.

00:28:40.920 --> 00:28:42.080 line:100%
Not bad.

00:28:42.160 --> 00:28:44.400 line:100%
What about my loss of profit?

00:28:48.360 --> 00:28:49.560 line:100%
That's easy.

00:28:51.480 --> 00:28:53.920 line:100%
We won't extort each other.

00:28:54.800 --> 00:28:56.560 line:100%
Aren't you the second in command
of the cement factory?

00:28:57.920 --> 00:28:59.000 line:100%
That's an important position.

00:28:59.720 --> 00:29:03.400 line:100%
Sign a contractor agreement with me
worth 300,000 yuan.

00:29:03.480 --> 00:29:04.400 line:100%
You're the client.

00:29:04.480 --> 00:29:05.360 line:100%
I'm the contractor.

00:29:05.960 --> 00:29:06.800 line:100%
Good enough?

00:29:07.640 --> 00:29:09.680 line:100%
Maybe we can just settle
the balance instead.

00:29:14.320 --> 00:29:16.280 line:100%
-Will you sign it or not?
-Yes!

00:29:16.360 --> 00:29:17.840 line:100%
Yes. Yes.

00:29:23.960 --> 00:29:27.920 line:100%
I like how decisive you are, Mr. Wu.

00:29:34.880 --> 00:29:35.720 line:100%
CONTRACTOR AGREEMENT

00:29:35.800 --> 00:29:37.120 line:100%
CLIENT: WU SHANLONG
CONTRACTOR: JIN MANSHAN

00:29:40.160 --> 00:29:42.720 line:100%
Tell them to tell Manlang.

00:29:43.240 --> 00:29:44.080 line:100%
Okay.

00:29:47.400 --> 00:29:48.440 line:100%
Speak.

00:29:49.360 --> 00:29:52.760 line:100%
Ms. Zhao forbids us
from mentioning Mengmeng.

00:29:52.840 --> 00:29:55.480 line:100%
My friends and I only gossip in secret.

00:29:56.000 --> 00:29:58.560 line:100%
They think a client is suspicious.

00:30:00.120 --> 00:30:00.920 line:100%
Who?

00:30:02.040 --> 00:30:04.440 line:100%
When he came, he only asked for Mengmeng.

00:30:04.520 --> 00:30:06.280 line:100%
And he paid double.

00:30:06.360 --> 00:30:07.880 line:100%
We call him Mr. Sun.

00:30:07.960 --> 00:30:09.040 line:100%
Mr. Sun?

00:30:09.680 --> 00:30:12.560 line:100%
He was already a regular at Pattia.

00:30:12.640 --> 00:30:15.520 line:100%
And he always came with a bag
of branded clothes.

00:30:15.600 --> 00:30:17.920 line:100%
The brands inside were so expensive.

00:30:19.240 --> 00:30:20.680 line:100%
Branded clothes.

00:30:21.960 --> 00:30:23.200 line:100%
Double Fish.

00:30:23.720 --> 00:30:24.960 line:100%
It's expensive.

00:30:26.280 --> 00:30:27.280 line:100%
Bowls.

00:30:28.240 --> 00:30:31.160 line:100%
This dress is probably
worth more than this unit.

00:30:35.200 --> 00:30:38.160 line:100%
Did Mr. Sun hand out goods
from Bowls and Double Fish?

00:30:39.360 --> 00:30:41.840 line:100%
Bowls and Double Fish…

00:30:43.600 --> 00:30:45.000 line:100%
I can't remember.

00:30:46.960 --> 00:30:48.680 line:100%
What is Mr. Sun's real name?

00:30:49.680 --> 00:30:50.600 line:100%
I'm not sure.

00:30:52.960 --> 00:30:56.440 line:100%
But after Mengmeng went missing,
Mr. Sun stopped showing up.

00:31:03.000 --> 00:31:07.400 line:100%
Sir, I've told you what I know.

00:31:07.480 --> 00:31:10.040 line:100%
I hope you can find Mengmeng soon.

00:31:10.120 --> 00:31:11.600 line:100%
I'm quite worried about her.

00:31:12.800 --> 00:31:15.000 line:100%
Don't worry. We've been searching for her.

00:31:15.080 --> 00:31:16.400 line:100%
Your information is very important.

00:31:16.480 --> 00:31:18.160 line:100%
Thank you, Lili.

00:31:18.240 --> 00:31:21.200 line:100%
If there's nothing else, I have to go now.

00:31:23.600 --> 00:31:24.320 line:100%
A HOME VISIT TO XU MENG’S UNCLE,
QIAO GUOQIANG.

00:31:24.400 --> 00:31:25.160 line:100%
CLEAR MARKS ON THE FLOOR
BY THE FOOT OF THE BED,

00:31:25.240 --> 00:31:25.960 line:100%
INDICATING IT HAS BEEN MOVED.

00:31:28.560 --> 00:31:29.520 line:100%
Oh.

00:31:29.600 --> 00:31:32.280 line:100%
When I was at Pattia,
a woman called Zhizhi

00:31:32.360 --> 00:31:34.200 line:100%
was quite close to Mr. Sun.

00:31:34.280 --> 00:31:35.920 line:100%
You can look for her.

00:31:42.520 --> 00:31:43.840 line:100%
Zhizhi.

00:31:45.680 --> 00:31:46.840 line:100%
Su Yuzhi.

00:31:49.080 --> 00:31:50.680 line:100%
A rich guy? What's his name?

00:31:50.760 --> 00:31:52.680 line:100%
Sun, I think.

00:31:52.760 --> 00:31:53.960 line:100%
His name?

00:31:54.960 --> 00:31:56.160 line:100%
I don't know.

00:32:00.160 --> 00:32:01.760 line:100%
She lied.

00:32:28.760 --> 00:32:30.400 line:100%
Adult Gaokao…

00:32:32.000 --> 00:32:34.240 line:100%
I thought only students sit for exams.

00:32:34.320 --> 00:32:36.720 line:100%
Adults have to do it too?

00:32:37.400 --> 00:32:39.160 line:100%
It's adult gaokao.

00:32:39.240 --> 00:32:41.840 line:100%
It's a chance for people like me
who never went to high school

00:32:41.920 --> 00:32:43.640 line:100%
to enter a university.

00:32:43.720 --> 00:32:46.760 line:100%
Oh. You want to impress Uncle Ran.

00:32:47.880 --> 00:32:49.920 line:100%
You're teasing me again.

00:32:51.200 --> 00:32:54.440 line:100%
Officer Ran is an ace student
from a prestigious school.

00:32:55.280 --> 00:32:59.440 line:100%
I started working after junior high.

00:33:00.960 --> 00:33:02.840 line:100%
So, I could only perform

00:33:04.160 --> 00:33:06.080 line:100%
physical labor,
like taking care of someone.

00:33:06.160 --> 00:33:09.320 line:100%
That's why I want to study hard,

00:33:09.400 --> 00:33:12.600 line:100%
get a degree, and find a good job.

00:33:13.200 --> 00:33:16.000 line:100%
-You can do this.
-Why do you say so?

00:33:16.080 --> 00:33:18.720 line:100%
Because you are the hardworking Ms. Qiao.

00:33:18.800 --> 00:33:23.120 line:100%
My mom told me that hard work
could make your dreams come true.

00:33:24.400 --> 00:33:25.800 line:100%
Your mom is right.

00:33:30.280 --> 00:33:32.120 line:100%
I, too, have to study hard.

00:33:36.200 --> 00:33:39.040 line:100%
-Do you even understand it?
-That's why I have to study.

00:33:39.120 --> 00:33:42.320 line:100%
I want to be an ace student
like Uncle Ran.

00:33:43.480 --> 00:33:45.360 line:100%
Then, let's have a pinky promise.

00:33:45.440 --> 00:33:47.920 line:100%
We will both
be ace students in the future.

00:33:48.000 --> 00:33:49.120 line:100%
Sure.

00:33:50.400 --> 00:33:51.920 line:100%
You make a pinky promise,

00:33:52.000 --> 00:33:54.000 line:100%
you keep it all your life.

00:33:59.280 --> 00:34:04.280 line:100%
YUZHI BOUTIQUE

00:34:15.439 --> 00:34:18.120 line:100%
The latest collection.
Pick anything you like.

00:34:27.999 --> 00:34:29.039 line:100%
Excuse me.

00:34:34.080 --> 00:34:36.680 line:100%
Cutie. You're finally here.

00:34:36.760 --> 00:34:38.400 line:100%
Are you here to treat me to hotpot?

00:34:39.200 --> 00:34:40.320 line:100%
No.

00:34:40.999 --> 00:34:43.880 line:100%
I'm here to ask you about Mr. Sun.

00:34:44.400 --> 00:34:46.160 line:100%
You said you weren't
close to him last time.

00:34:46.240 --> 00:34:47.200 line:100%
You lied.

00:34:49.160 --> 00:34:51.920 line:100%
Without lying, how else
could I make you come to me?

00:34:54.240 --> 00:34:55.240 line:100%
It's a game of flirting.

00:34:55.840 --> 00:34:57.000 line:100%
Su Yuzhi.

00:34:57.080 --> 00:34:58.680 line:100%
I brought him here.

00:34:58.760 --> 00:35:00.960 line:100%
So, tell us the truth now.

00:35:01.040 --> 00:35:04.040 line:100%
Cutie, what truth do you want to hear?

00:35:07.400 --> 00:35:09.760 line:100%
Please tell me who Mr. Sun is.

00:35:11.720 --> 00:35:15.240 line:100%
Sun's name is Sun Zhengyong.

00:35:15.320 --> 00:35:16.440 line:100%
He's from Fujian.

00:35:16.520 --> 00:35:19.040 line:100%
He has shares in my boutique, too.

00:35:19.120 --> 00:35:20.520 line:100%
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:35:20.600 --> 00:35:22.520 line:100%
We are not intimate.

00:35:22.600 --> 00:35:24.680 line:100%
What about him and Xu Meng?

00:35:28.000 --> 00:35:29.200 line:100%
If I tell you,

00:35:29.280 --> 00:35:31.040 line:100%
will you still come to me in the future?

00:35:33.720 --> 00:35:35.480 line:100%
Please… Please answer my question.

00:35:40.760 --> 00:35:42.880 line:100%
Did Sun Zhengyong give this dress to you?

00:35:42.960 --> 00:35:44.440 line:100%
Mind your tongue now.

00:35:47.760 --> 00:35:50.400 line:100%
I bought it from him. Wholesale.

00:35:54.320 --> 00:35:55.600 line:100%
FASHION BOUTIQUE

00:35:57.360 --> 00:35:59.360 line:100%
This is… A counterfeit?

00:35:59.440 --> 00:36:01.840 line:100%
Counterfeits sell like hot cakes.

00:36:01.920 --> 00:36:04.880 line:100%
So, Sun Zhengyong
bought the authentic products,

00:36:04.960 --> 00:36:06.880 line:100%
then made counterfeits
to sell them in wholesale.

00:36:07.480 --> 00:36:09.000 line:100%
Cutie, you're smart.

00:36:09.080 --> 00:36:11.480 line:100%
You figured it out.

00:36:16.280 --> 00:36:17.800 line:100%
How does he deal
with the authentic products?

00:36:17.880 --> 00:36:21.680 line:100%
Normally, he gives them to girls he likes.

00:36:22.400 --> 00:36:24.320 line:100%
He gives them to Xu Meng?

00:36:24.400 --> 00:36:25.640 line:100%
I guess so.

00:36:25.720 --> 00:36:27.080 line:100%
He likes Mengmeng the most.

00:36:27.160 --> 00:36:30.520 line:100%
Are you saying Mr. Sun has something to do
with Mengmeng's disappearance?

00:36:31.320 --> 00:36:32.240 line:100%
What do you think?

00:36:33.440 --> 00:36:34.600 line:100%
I don't know.

00:36:37.560 --> 00:36:39.360 line:100%
I saw them argue once.

00:36:39.960 --> 00:36:41.200 line:100%
When was it? And where?

00:36:41.280 --> 00:36:43.000 line:100%
At Pattia.

00:36:43.080 --> 00:36:44.600 line:100%
Mr. Sun was drunk.

00:36:44.680 --> 00:36:47.800 line:100%
He hugged Mengmeng
and asked her to be his girlfriend.

00:36:47.880 --> 00:36:50.600 line:100%
Mengmeng said no,
and Mr. Sun lost his patience.

00:36:50.680 --> 00:36:52.840 line:100%
He said Mengmeng played hard to get
and looked down on him.

00:36:52.920 --> 00:36:54.280 line:100%
They then argued.

00:36:59.440 --> 00:37:01.240 line:100%
-And then?
-And then?

00:37:02.240 --> 00:37:04.160 line:100%
You raided Pattia.

00:37:08.920 --> 00:37:12.400 line:100%
Is there any place in Weiyang
that sells authentic Bowls dresses?

00:37:12.480 --> 00:37:14.680 line:100%
It's a huge brand.

00:37:14.760 --> 00:37:16.560 line:100%
There's one official store in Weiyang.

00:37:16.640 --> 00:37:18.080 line:100%
Right inside Weiyang Mall.

00:37:18.160 --> 00:37:21.480 line:100%
Can you give us the wholesale address
of Sun Zhengyong?

00:37:31.560 --> 00:37:32.800 line:100%
NANMEN WHOLESALE MARKET
NANSHAN DISTRICT, WEIYANG CITY

00:37:32.880 --> 00:37:33.720 line:20%
FASHION CLOTHING HALL

00:37:35.720 --> 00:37:36.920 line:100%
Oh.

00:37:41.520 --> 00:37:43.160 line:100%
Remember the surprise I promised you?

00:37:44.680 --> 00:37:46.360 line:100%
We have a rule. We can't…

00:37:46.880 --> 00:37:48.400 line:100%
I know.

00:37:49.280 --> 00:37:50.840 line:100%
I'll charge you the original price.

00:37:51.720 --> 00:37:52.960 line:100%
Five yuan.

00:37:57.040 --> 00:37:57.960 line:100%
Take it.

00:37:58.920 --> 00:38:01.280 line:100%
If you don't buy it,
she's going to lure you in again.

00:38:10.440 --> 00:38:12.240 line:100%
Thank you, Su Yuzhi.

00:38:12.760 --> 00:38:14.560 line:100%
I wish you a prosperous business.

00:38:20.520 --> 00:38:21.600 line:100%
See you.

00:38:28.840 --> 00:38:29.920 line:100%
Why not put it on now?

00:38:35.640 --> 00:38:36.480 line:100%
He.

00:38:37.360 --> 00:38:39.760 line:100%
I think Su Yuzhi
is telling the truth this time.

00:38:40.360 --> 00:38:41.640 line:100%
Of course.

00:38:41.720 --> 00:38:43.480 line:100%
She is so devoted to you.

00:38:43.560 --> 00:38:44.400 line:100%
He.

00:38:44.480 --> 00:38:46.320 line:100%
We're investigating a case. Be serious.

00:38:47.520 --> 00:38:48.600 line:100%
Sure.

00:38:48.680 --> 00:38:50.920 line:100%
Then, analyze this seriously.

00:38:51.520 --> 00:38:54.600 line:100%
Perhaps Sun Zhengyong
thought Xu Meng looked down on him.

00:38:55.720 --> 00:38:58.360 line:100%
His love turned into hatred,
and he killed her.

00:39:05.360 --> 00:39:06.720 line:100%
YONG'S FASHION

00:39:06.800 --> 00:39:08.640 line:100%
Let me meet him in his shop.

00:39:08.720 --> 00:39:12.040 line:100%
I'll visit the official Bowls store
to check when he purchased the dress.

00:39:13.000 --> 00:39:14.240 line:100%
Not bad.

00:39:14.320 --> 00:39:15.840 line:100%
You've learned how to narrow down
the scope from me.

00:39:16.440 --> 00:39:17.640 line:100%
That's progress.

00:39:20.600 --> 00:39:23.480 line:100%
Also, we shouldn't give up
on the lead on Song Qingsong.

00:39:23.560 --> 00:39:25.440 line:100%
Be patient. One at a time.

00:40:04.280 --> 00:40:05.120 line:100%
What happened to your head?

00:40:05.720 --> 00:40:08.080 line:100%
What could be so serious
that you couldn't say it on the phone?

00:40:09.400 --> 00:40:10.920 line:100%
What else could it be?

00:40:11.920 --> 00:40:12.960 line:100%
If it's about Song, forget it.

00:40:15.000 --> 00:40:16.160 line:100%
Forget it?

00:40:16.960 --> 00:40:19.520 line:100%
Wu Shanlong. Are you taking me for a fool?

00:40:20.120 --> 00:40:21.400 line:100%
Two plans.

00:40:21.480 --> 00:40:23.080 line:100%
And both times,
you told me they were foolproof.

00:40:23.160 --> 00:40:24.440 line:100%
Then, what happened?

00:40:27.040 --> 00:40:29.360 line:100%
You're putting it as if it were my fault.

00:40:29.440 --> 00:40:31.080 line:100%
You came to me first,

00:40:31.160 --> 00:40:33.560 line:100%
saying that we could work together
to scam money out of Song.

00:40:35.880 --> 00:40:37.200 line:100%
I don't care about his money anymore.

00:40:38.240 --> 00:40:42.040 line:100%
Can you even hear what you just said?

00:40:43.600 --> 00:40:44.920 line:100%
The police are after Mengmeng.

00:40:46.120 --> 00:40:47.640 line:100%
Song Qingsong wants me to turn myself in.

00:40:51.600 --> 00:40:55.640 line:100%
So, if you turn yourself in
and they interrogate you,

00:40:55.720 --> 00:40:57.640 line:100%
will you rat me out?

00:41:04.680 --> 00:41:05.520 line:100%
I knew it.

00:41:05.600 --> 00:41:09.080 line:100%
If men were reliable, pigs could fly.

00:41:10.800 --> 00:41:12.520 line:100%
I was forced to.

00:41:12.600 --> 00:41:14.200 line:100%
Do you have a plan or not?

00:41:14.280 --> 00:41:16.480 line:100%
Didn't you just say my plan was useless?

00:41:16.560 --> 00:41:17.440 line:100%
Zhao Hongmei,

00:41:17.520 --> 00:41:19.600 line:100%
let me remind you
that we're both in the same boat.

00:41:24.000 --> 00:41:25.600 line:100%
We're past the point of no return.

00:41:25.680 --> 00:41:27.680 line:100%
We can't do this forever.

00:41:28.800 --> 00:41:30.000 line:100%
Wu Shanlong.

00:41:32.200 --> 00:41:34.120 line:100%
I want you to tell me the truth.

00:41:34.640 --> 00:41:36.000 line:100%
Otherwise, forget everything.

00:41:36.640 --> 00:41:37.720 line:100%
Mengmeng.

00:41:39.680 --> 00:41:41.840 line:100%
Is she dead or alive?

00:41:43.880 --> 00:41:45.080 line:100%
She's dead.

00:41:46.280 --> 00:41:47.600 line:100%
Stone cold dead!

00:41:50.360 --> 00:41:52.160 line:100%
For goodness's sake.